[N 30-33 Dungeon: City of Dalaran]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\Standalone dungeon chapter, for running the City of Dalaran ahead of the route: the two Stormwind lead-ins, An Alarming Request from Southshore, the two Modera quests at the crater, one run, and the hand-ins at the crater and in Stormwind.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  This chapter needs level 30: An Alarming Request (92432) requires it, and it opens Starving Arcane and Heart of Disruption (the Dalaran Sewer Key and the Defender of Dalaran); the two Stormwind quests need only 24. The four dungeon quests are level 33 and the mob levels inside are not in the data: under 32, go with a group that is 33+. Under 30 do not run it - the dungeon is never re-run for the two quests you would miss
[OC]|cffffffffStandalone|r  -  pick this chapter whenever a group forms; it is on no chain and repeats what chapters 15, 23, 27, 28 and 30 do for the City of Dalaran. Start in Stormwind. One dungeon in the Alterac crater, |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, one run, never a re-run: 12,510 quest XP on the four plain quests (An Alarming Request 660, three dungeon quests 3,950 each) and 4,215 more if the Arcane Mote drops. No hearth is assumed and nothing here rebinds it
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r quest ids, objectives, item stats and boss drops come from the Forever DB and the Wowhead Forever tooltips. Mob levels, elite status, the layout and the entrance are not in the data: Questie maps the dungeon mobs onto the city itself in the Alterac Mountains (x14-22, y55-76), so the pins inside are approximate

[OC]|cffffffffStormwind|r  -  the two lead-ins (already yours if you took them in the Gnomeregan dungeon chapter, in chapter 15 or in Back on Track: the steps then complete themselves)
In the Mage Quarter at [TAR5694 High Sorcerer Andromath], [QA92489 Power Overwhelming] (3,950 XP + 1g, quest level 33, requires 24: slay the Mana Elemental inside the City of Dalaran) [G48.7,87.6 Stormwind City]
In the Park at [TAR5502 Shylamiir] (herbalism trainer), [QA92456 A Green Sample] (3,950 XP, quest level 33, requires 24: a Fel Infused Blossom from inside the City of Dalaran) [G31.5,62.6 Stormwind City]
At [TAR352 Dungar Longdrink] on the gate ramp, |cFFfff8a3Fly to [F Southshore]|r (the game routes it through Ironforge) [G71.0,72.5 Stormwind City]
[OC]No Southshore flight path (it comes from chapter 08)? Fly to Menethil Harbor instead and take the boat that carries on to Southshore

[OC]|cffffffffSouthshore|r  -  one pickup, a few steps from the flight master
At [TAR247264 Emissary Jacques] of the Kirin Tor, [QA92432 An Alarming Request] (660 XP, requires level 30: report to the Image of Archmage Modera outside the City of Dalaran) [G48.3,60 Hillsbrad Foothills]

[OC]|cffffffffTo the crater|r  -  on foot from Southshore, Dalaran has no flight point. Keep WEST of the road north: Tarren Mill in the north-east is a Horde town. Cross the Hillsbrad Fields, then take the pass in the north-west corner into Alterac and down into the crater
Leave Southshore north-west to the Hillsbrad Fields [G33,42 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Go on north-west through the pass into the Alterac Mountains [G18,72 Alterac Mountains]
At the [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera] outside the city, [QT92432] (660 XP) [QA92457 Starving Arcane] [QA92458 Heart of Disruption] (3,950 XP each, requires level 24; both done inside - Heart of Disruption hands you the Dalaran Sewer Key) [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[OC]|cffffcc00Entrance (unverified):|r the sources disagree. Method: north-west outside the city, opened with the Dalaran Sewer Key from Heart of Disruption. foreverdb: through the Underbelly, no key. The pin below (8.5,59.2) is from an earlier note with no data behind it. Follow your tank if they know the way in. QuestieDB 1.1.1 has two portals a few steps north of Modera, to The Purple Parlor (14.4,57.5) and to The Violet Citadel (15.1,55.6) - neither is confirmed as the way in
|cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r Enter the City of Dalaran (entrance unverified, see above) [G8.5,59.2 Alterac Mountains]

[OC]|cffffffffThe City of Dalaran|r  -  |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, quests level 33 (requires 24). One run, never a re-run. Your quests, with the honest label:
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Starving Arcane (92457) - 8 Seeking Remnants, 8 Saturated Remnants and 8 Mana Echoes - |cff66ff66normal|r: the trash of the clear. 3,950 XP at Modera outside
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Power Overwhelming (92489) - slay the Mana Elemental, the boss Arcanic Enigma - |cff66ff66normal|r. 3,950 XP and 1 gold at High Sorcerer Andromath in Stormwind (end of this chapter)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r A Green Sample (92456) - 1 Fel Infused Blossom - |cff66ff66normal|r: an object, not in the data, so where it stands is unknown (perhaps the Fel Ancient's room). 3,950 XP at Shylamiir in Stormwind (end of this chapter)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Heart of Disruption (92458) - the Arcane Mote from the Shade of the Archmage - |cFFFF0000grind/luck, one kill only|r: Wowhead Forever shows 40.38% (counted over kills by players without the quest). If the Mote is not in his loot, do not re-run: abandon the quest at Modera. 3,950 XP at Modera, and Friend of the Kirin Tor (265 XP) after it
Kill 8 [TAR247003 Seeking Remnant], 8 [TAR247001 Saturated Remnant] and 8 [TAR246600 Mana Echo] on the clear (no positions for the Seeking Remnants in the data) [QC92457] [G17.1,67.2 Alterac Mountains]
[OC]|cffffcc00Trash loot (bind on equip):|r |cff66ff66Violet Sorcerer's Leggings|r (cloth legs +13 Int +5 Spi +12 spell damage, req 29; Saturated Remnants and others) score 51.3 on the weights, keep them. Roused Nature Footwraps (leather boots +6 Sta +9 Spi, healing) 30.5; Violet Sorcerer's Wraps (cloth gloves +9 Int, +1% hit) about 16.3, below Zodiac Gloves 22.1
Take a Fel Infused Blossom (the object is not in the data: look round the Fel Ancient's room first, unverified) [QC92456] [G16.7,67.7 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Fel Ancient):|r |cff66ff66Blightleaf Rope|r (cloth belt +10 Int +7 spell damage) 25.4, beats the Violet Sash, not Daewyn's Girdle 29.0 or the Demolition Girdle 34.0. Garb of Fallen Felbark (leather chest +9 Agi +7 Sta +13 Int) 23.5 loses to a Raptorbane or Snapbrook chest and to the Violet Sorcerer's Robes. Felbough Arm is a polearm: pass
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Mana Devourer):|r Spine of the Devourer (staff 20.7 dps +14 Sta +36 spell damage) is below every two-hander you carry; Slitherwrap Girdle and the Manascale Treads (mail): pass
Kill [TAR246016 Arcanic Enigma], the Mana Elemental [QC92489] [G21.2,63.1 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Arcanic Enigma):|r |cff66ff66Violet Sorcerer's Robes|r (cloth chest +15 Int +9 spell damage) 35.1 on the weights, the chest of the run, ROLL. |cff66ff66Drape of Shifting Energy|r (cloak +7 Spi +12 attack power) 29.5, beats the Glowing Thresher Cape and the Dustcover. The wand: pass
[O]Kill [TAR246020 Shade of the Archmage] and loot the Arcane Mote [QC92458] (~40% - one kill only: no Mote, no re-run) [G15.2,55.9 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Shade of the Archmage):|r Archmagister's Faceted Pendant (neck +6 Int +12 attack power) 18.8, only over a neck weaker than the Giantstone Medallion or Thermaplugg Medal (25.0). Violet Sorcerer's Mantle (+9 Int) and the Ponderous Orb (off-hand): pass. Babagahnoosh drops only a Dalaran Mana Gem
[OC]|cffffcc00Leaving:|r walk out the way you came, back to Modera outside the city

[OC]|cffffffffHand-ins outside|r  -  Modera and Archmage Celindra stand a few steps apart
At [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera], [QT92457] (3,950 XP) - |cffffcc00Gear:|r Fallen Guard's Pendant (+3 Str) or the Arcane Infused Rod (off-hand, no use with a two-hander): vendor either [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[O]At [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera], [QT92458] (3,950 XP, only with the Arcane Mote) - |cffffcc00Gear:|r |cff66ff66Defender of Dalaran|r (2H mace 31.21 dps +9 Str +13 Sta +9 Int, 465.2 on the weights) beats Heavehammer and the Crowd Pummeler, unless you won Thermaplugg's Left Arm (476.8); then Renewing Footpads (leather boots +5 Sta +11 Int, 20.5) only if your boots score under that (Disjointed Shoes are 22.0). Spellguard Pauldrons are mail [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[O]No Arcane Mote dropped: abandon Heart of Disruption here, do not re-run [QS92458] [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[O]At [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera], [QA92459 Friend of the Kirin Tor] (only offered once Heart of Disruption is handed in) [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[O]At [TAR252085 Archmage Celindra] beside her, [QT92459] (265 XP, no reward) [G14.2,60.0 Alterac Mountains]

[OC]|cffffffffBack to Stormwind|r  -  hearth if yours is bound in the south (from Sentinel Hill, Thor flies to Stormwind); otherwise walk back to Southshore the way you came and fly from Darla Harris (49.3,52.3)
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Gear (92489):|r take the |cff66ff66Violet Sash|r (cloth waist +9 Int, +6 spell damage; 22.3 on the weights, 16.3 conservative) if your belt scores under it, else the Runebound Gloves (leather +7 Sta +4 Spi, +12 attack power; 22.0, 18.0) if your gloves score under them; if neither is an upgrade, take the Runebound Gloves to vendor (19s 38c against 15s 85c)
In the Mage Quarter at [TAR5694 High Sorcerer Andromath], [QT92489] (3,950 XP + 1g) [G48.7,87.6 Stormwind City]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Gear (92456):|r the Vine Pruner's Cloak (+6 Sta, +5 spell damage; 10.0, 5.0) only over a plainer cloak; the Thorn Protecting Girdle is MAIL: pass until 40. Either sells for about 23s 60c
In the Park at [TAR5502 Shylamiir], [QT92456] (3,950 XP) [G31.5,62.6 Stormwind City]
